Here's my code for the first example:
float a;
while(a>0)
// Store a here, this is called the body of the while
a=a-1;
If you get a problem with your loop using the while statement, you can use the break statement:
void myFunction(void)
while(a>0) break;
// Store a here, this is called the body of the while.
cout<<"How many days of the week does it end in "<<a;
